# suite TARGAP1 customer lifecycle, pa
ok 1 - VALIDATE reaches a decision on a seeded account
ok 2 - A complete account names no missing information
ok 3 - An incomplete account is refused with CUS0010
ok 4 - An unknown lifecycle step is refused with CUS0098
ok 5 - Suspension without a reason is refused with CUS0014
ok 6 - A refused suspension carries an error return code
ok 7 - Retirement without a reason is refused too
ok 8 - Retiring an account leaves every open item in place
ok 9 - A relationship without a counterparty is refused
ok 10 - An account cannot be its own paying party
ok 11 - Only invoiced, paying and statement roles exist
ok 12 - A paying party relationship is accepted
ok 13 - Naming a payer moves no debt off the other account
ok 14 - The paying party is reported on the relate
ok 15 - The statement party is reported on the relate
ok 16 - A later read returns the paying party held
ok 17 - A later read returns the statement party held
ok 18 - The invoiced party read back is the one held
ok 19 - A credit note may not return stock (ARC0003)
ok 20 - The stock returning credit note is an
ok 21 - No credit note was created for a refused request
ok 22 - A value credit must name the original invoice
ok 23 - A credit note without a reason is refused
ok 24 - A credit note with no lines is refused
ok 25 - The original invoice gross is read back
ok 26 - Remaining creditable is gross less prior credits
ok 27 - Crediting does not edit the original invoice
ok 28 - A credit beyond the remaining amount is refused
1..28
# TARGAP1 customer lifecycle, pa passed 00028 failed 00000
# exit 0
